{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Silent Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag it to the screen edge and it will snap to the border. No large icons on the taskbar - find it through the hidden icons tray for easier access during work hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Considerate Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Been working too long? Get up and stretch! Do some Kegel exercises to prevent hemorrhoids! Stay hydrated for better health! More thoughtful than your boss - while it can't pay your salary, it does consume your boss's electricity (even just a tiny bit), which technically means you're getting some petty revenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Work Companion Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set your daily off-duty time. If you're unlucky enough to work overtime, Butt will vent about your boss to provide emotional support. Just remember to dismiss the messages promptly - wouldn't want the boss to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May all players encounter bosses who never demand overtime and pay generous salaries! Wishing you the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's boss-complaining dialogue may contain sharp language (including profanity), but there is no nudity or sexual content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648180?t=1745579266","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648180?t=1745579266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648180/19ed7919027656438f18f95df4bf755b34256990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745579266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648180/19ed7919027656438f18f95df4bf755b34256990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745579266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game does not contain any nudity, but there are instances of highly aggressive profanity directed at bosses."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Silent Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag it to the screen edge and it will snap to the border. No large icons on the taskbar - find it through the hidden icons tray for easier access during work hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Considerate Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Been working too long? Get up and stretch! Do some Kegel exercises to prevent hemorrhoids! Stay hydrated for better health! More thoughtful than your boss - while it can't pay your salary, it does consume your boss's electricity (even just a tiny bit), which technically means you're getting some petty revenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Work Companion Ass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set your daily off-duty time. If you're unlucky enough to work overtime, Butt will vent about your boss to provide emotional support. Just remember to dismiss the messages promptly - wouldn't want the boss to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May all players encounter bosses who never demand overtime and pay generous salaries! Wishing you the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's boss-complaining dialogue may contain sharp language (including profanity), but there is no nudity or sexual content.</p>","developers":["\u6574\u4e2a\u70c2\u6d3b"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648180/ac584c5ed67ff9a3a53a57d1f8dbcd1168d510bb/header.jpg?t=1745579266","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlig